1
00:00:47,422 --> 00:00:48,548
Are you avoiding me?

2
00:00:48,631 --> 00:00:49,924
Mikoy!

3
00:00:51,468 --> 00:00:52,802
No, I didn't know it was you.

4
00:00:52,886 --> 00:00:53,970
How are you?

5
00:00:54,471 --> 00:00:56,890
I didn't tell anyone
that you're my informant.

6
00:00:59,309 --> 00:01:00,560
But I need your help.

7
00:01:00,643 --> 00:01:03,188
So Dad's death won't be for nothing.

8
00:01:03,271 --> 00:01:04,606
Yes, bro.

9
00:01:09,319 --> 00:01:11,613
<i>Sir, I'm very disappointed</i>
<i>that you left me behind here.</i>

10
00:01:11,696 --> 00:01:13,948
<i>I thought it was supposed to be</i>
<i>until the end of time.</i>

11
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:21,456
What happened to the GAGO?

12
00:01:29,214 --> 00:01:30,924
If I still have feelings for her?

13
00:01:31,007 --> 00:01:32,383
You know, honestly, I don't know.

14
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:33,676
But I don't care.

15
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:35,303
Because all my heart wants right now

16
00:01:35,386 --> 00:01:37,472
is to get justice
for what she did to my father.

17
00:01:37,555 --> 00:01:39,140
So tell me, Agent Alex,

18
00:01:39,224 --> 00:01:40,308
that you can do

19
00:01:40,391 --> 00:01:43,019
what needs to be done
when the time comes.

20
00:02:15,135 --> 00:02:16,219
I will.

21
00:02:32,569 --> 00:02:33,778
Thank you.

22
00:02:48,167 --> 00:02:50,837
Alex, let's go.

23
00:03:20,909 --> 00:03:22,118
Enough, you two.

24
00:03:23,244 --> 00:03:25,955
We already have enough
internal squabbles in our world.

25
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:27,624
Let's not make things worse.

26
00:03:39,552 --> 00:03:40,637
So here's the deal.

27
00:03:58,655 --> 00:04:00,156
Papa, just let him be.

28
00:04:06,079 --> 00:04:09,040
They told me that the first to arrive

29
00:04:09,749 --> 00:04:12,210
at the meeting place will be his father.

30
00:04:15,338 --> 00:04:16,589
They only have one request.

31
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:27,016
Just me and Chiara and a few bodyguards,

32
00:04:28,685 --> 00:04:30,478
in order to not attract attention.

33
00:04:41,281 --> 00:04:42,865
With me and La Fornarina there,

34
00:04:43,574 --> 00:04:44,909
they won't stand a chance.

35
00:04:45,576 --> 00:04:46,911
Just the two of us,

36
00:04:47,745 --> 00:04:50,665
we can easily take out
an entire battalion of their goons.

37
00:04:51,249 --> 00:04:54,127
You're being way
too overconfident, Rahmboy.

38
00:05:00,883 --> 00:05:02,593
They can't kill us.

39
00:06:00,526 --> 00:06:02,904
I also activated our lines at the embassy,

40
00:06:02,987 --> 00:06:05,948
just in case we need
diplomatic intervention.

41
00:06:12,789 --> 00:06:15,666
We must protect our agents.

42
00:07:17,019 --> 00:07:20,648
Sir. We're here to monitor
and make sure there are no problems.

43
00:07:24,026 --> 00:07:26,320
We have a local militia group
that we could activate

44
00:07:26,404 --> 00:07:29,740
if Agent Mikoy and Agent Alex
need reinforcements.

45
00:07:42,170 --> 00:07:44,213
Sir, like Yancy said,

46
00:07:44,964 --> 00:07:46,799
we're here,

47
00:07:46,883 --> 00:07:50,094
as an additional tool
at your disposal, sir.

48
00:07:51,471 --> 00:07:54,140
We don't need it, and we won't use it.

49
00:07:54,223 --> 00:07:55,349
Okay?

50
00:08:06,194 --> 00:08:07,820
Yes, sir. No problem.

51
00:08:18,164 --> 00:08:20,124
Wait, why are we here?

52
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:26,964
They changed the meeting place
at the last minute.

53
00:08:27,048 --> 00:08:29,091
- Let's move.
- Wait, Mikoy. Mikoy.

54
00:08:29,175 --> 00:08:30,384
Are you sure?

55
00:08:30,468 --> 00:08:32,929
The tracker says Francesco hasn't moved.

56
00:08:33,012 --> 00:08:34,055
It could be a trap.

57
00:08:36,557 --> 00:08:39,227
Alex, when you made me your police asset,

58
00:08:39,894 --> 00:08:42,813
what made you so sure
that I could be trusted?

59
00:08:48,152 --> 00:08:49,487
We're the same, Alex.

60
00:08:50,530 --> 00:08:52,573
I have complete faith in my asset.

61
00:08:58,412 --> 00:09:00,581
That's why they keep changing locations.

62
00:09:04,293 --> 00:09:06,963
We didn't scout the area,
so we'll improvise.

63
00:09:09,715 --> 00:09:11,217
You stay here on the ground.

64
00:09:15,346 --> 00:09:16,347
Alex.

65
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:18,516
Be careful.

66
00:11:28,896 --> 00:11:29,980
Let's go.

67
00:12:04,557 --> 00:12:05,683
What's happening?

68
00:12:06,267 --> 00:12:08,060
The Castellanis made
some last-minute changes.

69
00:12:08,144 --> 00:12:09,979
They changed the meeting place for Chiara.

70
00:12:21,323 --> 00:12:22,491
It's possible.

71
00:12:22,575 --> 00:12:24,410
Maybe they're afraid of Chiara too.

72
00:12:41,510 --> 00:12:42,761
Let them be for now.

73
00:12:53,481 --> 00:12:54,773
I don't have a clear shot.

74
00:12:55,357 --> 00:12:56,442
If you don't have a shot,

75
00:12:56,525 --> 00:12:57,610
I can move in.

76
00:13:09,914 --> 00:13:11,248
- Nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you.

77
00:14:03,425 --> 00:14:04,969
<i>They're going inside, Mikoy.</i>

78
00:14:08,806 --> 00:14:10,558
We can't rush this.

79
00:14:10,641 --> 00:14:12,184
We haven't scouted the area yet.

80
00:14:14,228 --> 00:14:15,396
You okay up there?

81
00:14:16,438 --> 00:14:17,648
I'm okay.

82
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:20,234
<i>You might be getting lonely up there.</i>

83
00:14:25,823 --> 00:14:26,824
Just say the word, okay?

84
00:14:29,410 --> 00:14:31,203
Can you stop messing with me?

85
00:14:32,079 --> 00:14:33,247
That's just like you.

86
00:14:37,376 --> 00:14:38,878
Just trying to ease the tension.

87
00:14:39,628 --> 00:14:42,673
You know, considering our situation.

88
00:14:44,049 --> 00:14:47,636
Sometimes, you just
can't control your heart.

89
00:14:49,805 --> 00:14:52,308
Who knew I'd fall for a police asset?

90
00:15:01,025 --> 00:15:03,110
Did you tell them that

91
00:15:03,193 --> 00:15:06,280
we can hear their conversation
on our comms?

92
00:15:06,363 --> 00:15:10,910
That our signal is directly patched
into their comms?

93
00:15:11,410 --> 00:15:12,494
My assumption, sir, was that

94
00:15:12,578 --> 00:15:14,747
I didn't need to tell them

95
00:15:14,830 --> 00:15:16,040
because they already know that

96
00:15:16,123 --> 00:15:19,126
this is standard operating procedure
for missions like this.

97
00:15:22,421 --> 00:15:25,925
Let's not act like
high school kids getting all giddy.

98
00:15:27,635 --> 00:15:29,386
Isolate this.

99
00:15:29,470 --> 00:15:30,638
Try to…

100
00:15:30,721 --> 00:15:31,764
I said keep it down.

101
00:15:31,847 --> 00:15:33,432
They're saying something!

102
00:15:33,515 --> 00:15:35,768
Never mind. They're having a moment!

103
00:15:47,446 --> 00:15:49,198
- Sorry, sir.
- Sorry, sir.

104
00:15:49,281 --> 00:15:52,868
So, sir, should I mute it?

105
00:15:54,787 --> 00:15:57,498
Listen in! But act professionally, okay?

106
00:17:41,185 --> 00:17:42,770
Correct! Correct.

107
00:18:12,466 --> 00:18:15,511
<i>Alex, the Castellanis are moving.</i>
<i>They're heading our way.</i>

108
00:18:25,104 --> 00:18:26,063
Let's go.

109
00:19:06,812 --> 00:19:07,855
If Mikoy is there,

110
00:19:07,938 --> 00:19:08,981
that means Alex is there too.

111
00:19:17,865 --> 00:19:19,283
Is the back door safe?

112
00:19:19,366 --> 00:19:20,534
There's no line of sight at the back.

113
00:19:21,326 --> 00:19:23,328
All the open shots are in front.

114
00:19:23,412 --> 00:19:24,746
Thank you.

115
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:32,296
- Okay?
- Yes.

116
00:19:35,883 --> 00:19:37,384
Be careful!

117
00:19:41,138 --> 00:19:43,807
Because he's highly motivated
to kill us all.

118
00:19:51,857 --> 00:19:54,067
- You take the back door, okay?
- But, Papa…

119
00:19:55,235 --> 00:19:56,653
No buts, okay?

120
00:19:58,906 --> 00:19:59,948
- Let's move.
- Come on.

121
00:20:01,658 --> 00:20:02,951
Be careful.

122
00:21:27,953 --> 00:21:28,954
Is she a good shot?

123
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:31,790
She's better than a dead-eye shot.

124
00:21:31,873 --> 00:21:33,166
Then we're good!

125
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:34,459
But here's what I want.

126
00:21:35,210 --> 00:21:37,713
I want to be the one to finish Chiara.

127
00:21:39,131 --> 00:21:40,090
Mikoy.

128
00:21:42,301 --> 00:21:43,760
I want her to see me.

129
00:21:43,844 --> 00:21:46,179
I want her to know that I'm the one
who delivered justice for Dad,

130
00:21:46,263 --> 00:21:47,889
and that I was the one who finished her.

131
00:21:51,977 --> 00:21:53,854
So, what do you want me to do?

132
00:21:55,731 --> 00:21:57,733
I need you to create a distraction.

133
00:21:58,233 --> 00:22:00,527
Something good enough for me
to get close to her.

134
00:22:02,612 --> 00:22:03,530
How?

135
00:22:05,657 --> 00:22:07,451
I know it sounds crazy,

136
00:22:07,534 --> 00:22:08,785
but I need you

137
00:22:08,869 --> 00:22:11,788
to leak our identities,
Alex's and mine, to the Italians.

138
00:22:44,279 --> 00:22:46,364
Mikoy!

139
00:22:49,659 --> 00:22:50,869
Hurry, hurry.

140
00:22:51,578 --> 00:22:52,621
Hurry up!

141
00:22:53,288 --> 00:22:54,456
Let’s go, let's go.

142
00:23:11,181 --> 00:23:13,225
Don’t worry, I’ll handle him.

143
00:23:14,976 --> 00:23:16,103
What’s your plan?

144
00:23:16,186 --> 00:23:19,189
Fix the problem without any noise.

145
00:23:24,277 --> 00:23:26,238
<i>Looks like we are not</i>
<i>in Castellani’s radar now.</i>

146
00:23:26,321 --> 00:23:28,990
He spread a rumor about us escaping.

147
00:23:29,074 --> 00:23:32,410
Seems like that asset of yours
is trustworthy.

148
00:23:35,163 --> 00:23:36,039
Sorry about what?

149
00:23:36,123 --> 00:23:38,625
I'm sorry you weren't able to do
what you were supposed to do here.

150
00:23:38,708 --> 00:23:42,295
I have the rest of my life
to make her pay for what she did.

151
00:23:46,842 --> 00:23:48,426
Here’s my gift.

152
00:23:51,805 --> 00:23:55,225
If you want to slice Mikoy’s neck.

153
00:23:59,521 --> 00:24:01,606
<i>We have another time for this.</i>

154
00:24:01,690 --> 00:24:04,442
For now, you have to go back to Alex.

155
00:24:04,526 --> 00:24:05,777
What is it this time?!

156
00:24:06,570 --> 00:24:07,404
What did you do?

157
00:24:11,533 --> 00:24:12,826
Damn!
